awesome-grokbot — licence summary
=================================

This repository is not uniformly licensed, because its inputs are not.

Scripts (`scripts/`, `schema/`)
    MIT License — see LICENSE-MIT.

Catalog data (`catalog.json`, `retired.json`)
    Per-row. Each entry declares its own `license` field:

      CC0-1.0     Derived only from CC0 / MIT upstream catalogs, plus this
                  repository's own contributions. No conditions.
                  See LICENSE-CC0.

      CC-BY-4.0   Inherited descriptive text from ZeroPointRepo/GrokBotDev,
                  whose `content/` is licensed CC BY 4.0. Attribution is
                  required and is carried by the `sources[]` array on the row
                  itself. If you reuse these rows, carry that attribution
                  forward. https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

    Facts in the catalog — a bot's name, its share URL, who shared it, and
    whether the link resolves — are not copyrightable and no rights are
    asserted over them.

Contributions original to this repository
    The Chinese summaries, the hand-corrected categories, the link-status
    measurements, the schema and the scripts are dedicated to the public
    domain under CC0-1.0 (data) and MIT (code).

Documentation (`README*.md`, `docs/`)
    CC0-1.0, except where it quotes or paraphrases an upstream source, which
    is attributed inline.

The bots themselves
    Every bot linked from this catalog belongs to its author. This repository
    links to public share pages and paraphrases what those pages say. It does
    not host, copy, or redistribute any bot profile, prompt, or configuration.

Full attribution and per-source licence notes: docs/sources.md
